      "JUDY: Hi!\nKENDRA: Good morning. Are you Judy?\nJUDY: Yes! I’m Judy! Are you Kendra?\nKENDRA: Kendra Carter, pleasure.",
      "KENDRA: It’s nice.\nJUDY: Thank you. We think so. Most people drive north to St. Thomas these days, but... we still find plenty to do.\nKENDRA: Where will they be meeting?\nJUDY: Oh. Sorry...",
      "JUDY: We hold most meetings in here, but Charlotte thought they should have more privacy, so we’ll put them in back.\nKENDRA: If you think it’s best.\nJUDY: Yeah, I think so... I mean, it’s much nicer. Lots of light.\nKENDRA: And Linda approved?",
      "KENDRA: Will we hear the music back here?\nJUDY: Oh shoot. Will that be a problem?\nKENDRA: It might be can they stop?\nJUDY: They’re having lessons today...",
      "KENDRA: I just don’t want it to be a distraction.\nJUDY: Of course, we’ll talk to them. You want to see back here?\nKENDRA: Thank you."
